--------------------------------------------
MATLAB code for Resource Balance Analysis (RBA)
and symbolic RBA model construction

Wolfram Liebermeister (2019-2026)
--------------------------------------------


INSTALLATION

  1. Unpack the files
  2. Include the subdirectory 'rba' (with all subdirectories) into your Matlab path
  3. Make sure that the following toolboxes are installed and in your Matlab path:
      o Matlab utility functions   (https://github.com/liebermeister/matlab-utils)
      o Metabolic Network Toolbox  (https://github.com/liebermeister/metabolic-network-toolbox)
      o SBtab toolbox              (https://github.com/liebermeister/sbtab-matlab)
     and the Matlab Optimization Toolbox (function linprog)
  4. Run the tests: rba_symbolic_test


